  "question": {
    "text": "If the area enclosed by <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> square units, then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/Z2matmat.JPG\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 130px;\" /><br /><br />Given equation is&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> or <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></math> and <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></math><br /><br />Solving <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></math> with the equation of the parabola, we get,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br />Hence, the pair of lines are tangent to the parabola.<br /><br />So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>",
